{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03121","headline":"奉和圣制过王濬墓 · 张九龄","name":"奉和圣制过王濬墓","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"汉王思钜鹿，晋将在弘农。\n入蜀举长筭，平吴成大功。\n与浑虽不协，归皓实爲雄。\n孤绩沦千载，流名感圣衷。\n万乘度荒陇，一顾凛生风。\n古节犹不弃，今人争效忠。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张九龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03121.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03121","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}